--- dot-segment walks out of /auth/v1 ---
404  /auth/v1/../rest/v1/tenants
404  /auth/v1/../../rest/v1/tenants
404  /auth/v1/../storage/v1/object/hive-files/x
--- dot-segment walks INTO the admin API ---
404  /rest/v1/../auth/v1/admin/users
404  /auth/v1/foo/../admin/users
--- percent-encoded dot segments ---
404  /auth/v1/%2e%2e/rest/v1/tenants
404  /auth/v1/..%2fadmin/users
404  /auth/v1/%2e%2e%2fadmin%2fusers
--- double slashes ---
404  //auth/v1/admin/users
404  /auth/v1//admin/users
404  /auth//v1/admin/users
--- case ---
404  /AUTH/V1/ADMIN/USERS
404  /Auth/V1/Health
404  /AUTH/V1/SIGNUP
--- semicolon and trailing dot tricks ---
404  /auth/v1/admin/users;
404  /auth/v1/admin/users/.
404  /auth/v1/admin;/users
